2843       data a (drop=i);
2844       do i=1 to 1000;
2845       x1=rannor(1234);
2846       x2=rannor(1234);
2847       e=rannor(1234);
2848       if i > 950 then y=100 + 10*e;
2849       else y=10 + 5*x1 + 3*x2 + 0.5 * e;
2850       output;
2851       end;
2852       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 1000 observations and 4 variables.

2853       proc quantreg data=a;
2854       model y = x1 x2 / seed=314159;
2855       
2856       performance cpucount=1;
2857       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE QUANTREG printed page 185.

